ete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p054","text":"　　易志性恬隱，不交外物。建元元年，刺史豫章王辟爲驃騎參軍，不就。臨川王映臨州，獨重易，上表薦之，餉麥百斛。易謂使人曰：「民樵採麋鹿之伍，終其解毛之衣，馳騁日月之車，得保自耕之祿，於大王之恩，亦已深矣。」辭不受。永明三年，詔徵太子舍人，不就。以文義自樂。安西長史袁彖欽其風，通書致遺。易以連理机竹翹書格報之。建武二年，詔復徵爲司徒主簿，不就。卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":140,"last_line":140,"raw_start":7499,"raw_end":7672,"raw_character_offsets":[7499,7500,7501,7502,7503,7504,7505,7506,7507,7508,7509,7510,7511,7512,7513,7514,7515,7516,7517,7518,7519,7520,7521,7522,7523,7524,7525,7526,7527,7528,7529,7530,7531,7532,7533,7534,7535,7536,7537,7538,7539,7540,7541,7542,7543,7544,7545,7546,7547,7548,7549,7550,7551,7552,7553,7554,7555,7556,7557,7558,7559,7560,7561,7562,7563,7564,7565,7566,7567,7568,7569,7570,7571,7572,7573,7574,7575,7576,7577,7578,7579,7580,7581,7582,7583,7584,7585,7586,7587,7588,7589,7590,7591,7592,7593,7594,7595,7596,7597,7598,7599,7600,7601,7602,7603,7604,7605,7606,7607,7608,7609,7610,7611,7612,7613,7614,7615,7616,7617,7618,7619,7620,7621,7622,7623,7624,7625,7626,7627,7628,7629,7630,7631,7632,7633,7634,7635,7636,7637,7638,7639,7640,7641,7642,7643,7644,7645,7646,7647,7648,7649,7650,7651,7652,7653,7654,7655,7656,7657,7658,7659,7660,7661,7662,7663,7664,7665,7666,7667,7668,7669,7670,7671],"revision_id":1762878},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p054:m0002","start":2,"end":3,"surface":"易","kind":"person","person_id":"e3g_qwe_o7m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p054:m0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"豫章王","kind":"person","person_id":"ijh_3fs_6u2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p054:m0033","start":33,"end":37,"surface":"臨川王映","kind":"person","person_id":"47p_kjh_ez7_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p054:m0131","start":131,"end":133,"surface":"袁彖","kind":"person","person_id":"x6r_6az_6zn","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059","text":"　　頃之，測送弟喪還西，仍留舊宅永業寺，絕賔友，唯與同志庾易、劉虯、宗人尚之等往來講說。刺史隨王子隆至鎮，遣別駕宗哲致勞問，測笑曰：「貴賤理隔，何以及此。」竟不答。建武二年，徵爲司徒主簿，不就，卒。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":152,"last_line":152,"raw_start":8160,"raw_end":8259,"raw_character_offsets":[8160,8161,8162,8163,8164,8165,8166,8167,8168,8169,8170,8171,8172,8173,8174,8175,8176,8177,8178,8179,8180,8181,8182,8183,8184,8185,8186,8187,8188,8189,8190,8191,8192,8193,8194,8195,8196,8197,8198,8199,8200,8201,8202,8203,8204,8205,8206,8207,8208,8209,8210,8211,8212,8213,8214,8215,8216,8217,8218,8219,8220,8221,8222,8223,8224,8225,8226,8227,8228,8229,8230,8231,8232,8233,8234,8235,8236,8237,8238,8239,8240,8241,8242,8243,8244,8245,8246,8247,8248,8249,8250,8251,8252,8253,8254,8255,8256,8257,8258],"revision_id":1762878},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059:m0005","start":5,"end":6,"surface":"測","kind":"person","person_id":"ou7_kzk_fb6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"庾易","kind":"person","person_id":"e3g_qwe_o7m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059:m0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"劉虯","kind":"person","person_id":"rp9_3uw_714","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"尚之","kind":"person","person_id":"qti_nn7_0v2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059:m0046","start":46,"end":50,"surface":"隨王子隆","kind":"person","person_id":"4tg_ud8_zdy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p059:m0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"宗哲","kin